    description: "Delete unwanted pages from a PDF for free online. Remove a single page or multiple pages from any PDF without Adobe Acrobat or any software.",
    publishedAt: "2026-04-29", category: "PDF Tools", readTime: 3,
    excerpt: "Need to remove the cover page, a blank page, or a confidential section from a PDF? Here is the fastest free way to do it.",
